      {
        tag: "event",
        id: "ev_35",
        on: "start",
        once: true,
        children: [
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Isthiniel",
            text: _("I felt our dead stirring and corruption descending on the forest. When I left to investigate, I expected to find grim, veiled forces at work. Instead I find a human mage boldly marching down our road! I will not allow you to continue to molest our peace, and you must release the dead you have enslaved."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Ardonna",
            text: _("Well, that I won’t do. However, if you do not attack, you will be rid of me soon, as I only wish to leave these woods."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Isthiniel",
            text: _("Attack? No, I cannot. Most of my people won’t come here; it is only duty that drives me. However, the woods themselves are disturbed, and they will cast you out on their own. I can feel them awaken."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:set_terrain",
            terrain: "Rb",
            cells: "23,3",
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:add_item",
            x: 24,
            y: 4,
            item_name: "",
            image: "items%2Fdirt1.png",
          },
          {
            tag: "spawn",
            id: "Dolmathengalin",
            type: "Ancient Wose",
            side: 2,
            x: 21,
            y: 2,
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:spawn_unit",
            unit: "Dolmathengalin",
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dolmathengalin",
            text: _("You are greeted daughter of elves. Why does the forest moan in despair?"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Vendraxis",
            text: _("That tree can talk!"),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Isthiniel",
            text: _("That dark mage has woken our dead and stifles the air with her very presence. Please wake your people, Elder, and destroy her."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Dolmathengalin",
            text: _("This shall be done."),
          },
          {
            tag: "message",
            speaker: "Isthiniel",
            text: _("I shall leave you. I have no wish to witness this violence."),
          },
          {
            tag: "hook",
            name: "command:kill_unit",
            unit: "Isthiniel",
          },
        ],
      },
